{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Kaiju is rampaging in the city and the people of the city\u00a0needs to stop it! An agent of\u00a0The Earth Defense Force is racing to activate the weapon towers while avoiding the Kaiju. Can they make it before they get smashed into jam?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read your opponent and predict their actions!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/e206fab2f8c18a18b6ad902964809a87.avif?t=1759257583\" data-has-big width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KaijuStory is a turn-based strategy, 1vs1 player game, where one player is a Kaiju and the other one is a human, an agent of the Earth Defense Force.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the Kaiju is to find the human player which is running around the city. The Kaiju use different abilities to find the human. In this case &quot;finding&quot; means smashing buildings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/d112c5b64f06c21490b80003702f7b6c.poster.avif?t=1759257583\" width=934 height=866 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/d112c5b64f06c21490b80003702f7b6c.webm?t=1759257583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/d112c5b64f06c21490b80003702f7b6c.mp4?t=1759257583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smash the human before they activate all 3 of the secret weapon towers in the city</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/6c35d60eb1d4cee90b5a355a94858427.poster.avif?t=1759257583\" width=666 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/6c35d60eb1d4cee90b5a355a94858427.webm?t=1759257583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/6c35d60eb1d4cee90b5a355a94858427.mp4?t=1759257583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >While the human travels the city trying to complete their goal, they leave traces which the Kaiju can see</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/1ad29713c2f65f78f703ad43a728de4d.poster.avif?t=1759257583\" width=738 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/1ad29713c2f65f78f703ad43a728de4d.webm?t=1759257583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/1ad29713c2f65f78f703ad43a728de4d.mp4?t=1759257583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Block the human from getting to the towers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/b09dfebb7c838faecc73126f04d77117.poster.avif?t=1759257583\" width=432 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/b09dfebb7c838faecc73126f04d77117.webm?t=1759257583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/b09dfebb7c838faecc73126f04d77117.mp4?t=1759257583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></v